'''Showing Leg''' (絶対領域, ''Zettai Ryōiki'', '''Absolute Territory''') was a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (Sm): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 26 frames (0.87 sec).

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Showing Leg|Research Power Up (Sm)|Heartful Nurse Cat|Kalisa, type χ|Skirt Cat|jpname=絶対領域|link=}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Showing Leg's Japanese name, [[wikipedia:Zettai Ryōiki|Zettai Ryōiki]] (絶対領域, "Absolute Territory"), refers to the area of bare thigh skin between a skirt and stockings or socks.
*Although this Combo was removed, it was effectively replaced by [[Checkered Skirt (Combo)|Checkered Skirt]], which has the same effect but doesn't require Heartful Nurse Cat.

